<title>FINLAND: Amer says H1 net sales fell 7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Amer says H1 net sales fell 7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish sporting goods group Amer-yhtyma Oy said on Tuesday its January-June net sales had fallen seven percent year-on-year to 2.27 billion markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Amer Group's net sales for the period January to June 1997 were 2,270 million markka, a decrease of 7 percent from the corresponding period,&quot; Amer said in a statement.  </p>
<p>&quot;Given stable exchange rates, net sales increased by seven percent,&quot; Amer said.</p>
<p>Sales outside Finland generated 90 percent of total net sales, and the sport division accounted for 87 percent of net sales, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
